{"channelId":"UCqFvLxrE6GjwRhIJXiGIffg","row":["Danielle Mullen Equine Physical Therapist",724,"Hi I'm Danielle and I am an equine physical therapist based in the UK.  I have been living my best life as an equine therapist since 2009 and I LOVE my work.  I use a range of different modalities including sports massage, trigger point therapy, Masterson Method and myofascial release for injury prevention, injury rehabilitation and to work towards optimum performance.  I am lucky enough to work on a wide range of horses from adored leisure horses and treasured golden oldies to performance horses working at the highest levels and I learn from each and every one of them - every day's a school day!  I hope you enjoy browsing my videos and I would love to hear from you either here or at my FB page - just search danielle equine sports massage.  Enjoy! X.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqFvLxrE6GjwRhIJXiGIffg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqFvLxrE6GjwRhIJXiGIffg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:46.195Z","channelId":"UCqFvLxrE6GjwRhIJXiGIffg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f0ed10ac108db1643f10f682393c711c8a7ea776a7be7fc2dcd6818c698436f0","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"3ae5c895322983260796eb13221701c7da76f3b5d32600f508d95dc597d61201"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/danielleequinesportsmassage","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":724,"raw":"724","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/danielleequinesportsmassage/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T04:24:52.268Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqFvLxrE6GjwRhIJXiGIffg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3,"raw":"3 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqFvLxrE6GjwRhIJXiGIffg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:46.195Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist"]